    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d533">

                <pb facs="0807" n="1315" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p2/pg1315"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/8–1648: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Special Representative of the United States in
                        Israel</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >McDonald</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tel Aviv</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-08-16T21:00:00+04:00">August 16, 1948—9
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>55. Mediator’s optimism reported from Stockholm about present truce finds no
                    supporting evidence here. On contrary, truce being broken nightly not only by
                    heavy fighting Jerusalem but by intermittent sniping several fronts. Destruction
                    [Latrun?] pumps attributed on seemingly irrefutable evidence by Colonel Perry,
                    UN observer Chargé that area, to Arab Legion and Arab irregulars and PGI assumption <pb facs="0808" n="1316"
                        xml:id="pg1316"/> Arab responsibility [are?] additional proof futility truce
                    and dangerous optimism of Mediator.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d533-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Personally convinced truce in reality not increasing chances peace but rather
                    contrary. Hence conditions appear to call for concentration efforts secure real
                    peace negotiations. I realize this point view parallels that recently expressed
                    by PGI but that does not invalidate soundness
                    point view.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McDonald</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d533-f1" n="1" xml:id="d533-f1-content">
                <p>Tel Aviv, on August 14, advised that the “Destruction Latrun pump station
                    seriously affects prestige UN here and increases Israeli skepticism efficacy
                    truce supervision.” (Telegram 52, 867N.01/8–1448)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
